  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Reading the diagram",
      "items": [
        "An edge from an actor is a use case it can start; its label names the CLI verbs or MCP tools",
        "Colour shows the surface; the sublabel starts with the status: changed (now also over MCP), gated, planned, idea",
        "The student starts study use cases by asking the host"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Between use cases",
      "items": [
        "Search, the tree and quizzes need indexed materials (UC-03)",
        "Questions are written per topic of the tree (UC-09)",
        "A quiz draws from the verified bank (UC-11)",
        "Mastery is shown on the topic-tree page (UC-10)",
        "Coding challenges extend the bank and quiz tools"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Gates and privacy",
      "items": [
        "The topic gate stores the whole tree or nothing",
        "Nothing unverified enters the question bank",
        "Answers live in progress.db, which is never exported",
        "An imported bundle is untrusted data"
      ]
    }
  ]
